---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/portfolio';
---

<Layout title="소개 | 박규태" description="연세대학교에서 수학을 공부하며, 추상적인 구조와 현실의 문제를 수학적으로 표현하는 과정에 관심을 두고 있습니다.">
  <article class="about-page">
    <header class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-portrait">
        <img src="/avatar.webp" alt="박규태" width="176" height="176" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
        <span aria-hidden="true">∴</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">About · Park Gyutae</p>
        <h1>수학을 공부하고,<br /><em>질문을 구현합니다.</em></h1>
        <p class="about-lead">연세대학교에서 수학을 공부하는 박규태입니다. 추상적인 구조를 이해하는 것과 현실의 문제를 수학의 언어로 다시 표현하는 과정에 관심이 있습니다.</p>
        <div class="about-actions">
          <a class="button-primary" href="mailto:rbparkxo@yonsei.ac.kr">이메일 보내기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="about-principle" aria-label="소개">
      <span class="section-number">01</span>
      <p>대수학과 정수론을 중심으로 공부하고, 확률론과 확률과정에도 관심을 두고 있습니다. 통계·최적화·프로그래밍은 아이디어를 실제 자료 위에서 시험하기 위한 도구로 사용합니다.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="interests-heading">
      <div class="section-heading numbered-heading">
        <span class="section-number">02</span>
        <div><p>Fields of Interest</p><h2 id="interests-heading">관심 분야</h2></div>
      </div>
      <div class="interest-grid">
        <article class="interest-card primary-card">
          <p>Mathematics</p>
          <h3>구조를 이해하는 공부</h3>
          <ul><li>Algebra & Number Theory</li><li>Probability & Stochastic Processes</li><li>Linear Algebra</li></ul>
          <span class="card-mark" aria-hidden="true">∑</span>
        </article>
        <article class="interest-card">
          <p>Exploring</p>
          <h3>현실로 이어지는 문제</h3>
          <ul><li>Cryptography</li><li>Optimization & Decision Problems</li><li>Statistical & Computational Methods</li></ul>
          <span class="card-mark" aria-hidden="true">P</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section about-details" aria-labelledby="background-heading">
      <div class="section-heading numbered-heading">
        <span class="section-number">03</span>
        <div><p>Background</p><h2 id="background-heading">공부와 작업</h2></div>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-row">
        <p class="detail-label">Education</p>
        <div><h3>Yonsei University</h3><p>B.S. in Mathematics · Undergraduate</p><small>대수학, 정수론, 확률과정론 등을 공부하고 있습니다.</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-row">
        <p class="detail-label">Tools</p>
        <div class="tool-list" aria-label="사용 도구"><span>Python</span><span>R</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>SQL</span><span>Git</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-row">
        <p class="detail-label">This space</p>
        <div><h3>개인 연구실이자 디지털 정원</h3><p>공부하며 이해한 수학, 직접 진행한 프로젝트, 그 과정의 시행착오와 생각을 기록합니다.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="about-contact">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Let’s connect</p><h2>질문과 대화를 환영합니다.</h2></div>
      <div class="contact-links">
        <a href="mailto:rbparkxo@yonsei.ac.kr"><span>Academic</span>rbparkxo@yonsei.ac.kr ↗</a>
        <a href="mailto:gyutae.q.park@gmail.com"><span>Personal</span>gyutae.q.park@gmail.com ↗</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-page { padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem) 0 5rem; }
  .about-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 190px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 6rem); align-items: center; max-width: 930px; min-height: 430px; margin: 0 auto clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .about-portrait { position: relative; width: 176px; }
  .about-portrait img { display: block; width: 176px; height: 176px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(8%); box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.11); }
  .about-portrait span { position: absolute; right: -1rem; bottom: -.8rem; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 3.4rem; height: 3.4rem; border: 5px solid var(--bg-color); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--primary-color); color: #fff; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .about-intro h1 { max-width: 680px; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 6vw, 5.2rem); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.055em; word-break: keep-all; }
  .about-intro h1 em { color: var(--primary-color); font-family: var(--font-handwriting); font-size: 1.05em; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .about-lead { max-width: 650px; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.85; word-break: keep-all; }
  .about-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .about-principle { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 45px minmax(0, 1fr); max-width: 930px; margin: 0 auto clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem); padding: 2rem 0; border-block: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
  .about-principle .section-number { color: var(--primary-color); font-family: var(--font-number); font-size: .9rem; }
  .about-principle p { max-width: 790px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.65rem); line-height: 1.7; letter-spacing: -.025em; word-break: keep-all; }
  .about-section { max-width: 930px; margin: 0 auto clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7rem); }
  .interest-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .interest-card { position: relative; min-height: 330px; padding: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 24px; background: var(--card-bg); }
  .interest-card > p { margin-bottom: .65rem; color: var(--primary-color); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .interest-card h3 { max-width: 280px; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem); letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .interest-card ul { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: grid; gap: .7rem; padding: 0; list-style: none; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .interest-card li::before { content: '—'; margin-right: .55rem; color: var(--primary-color); }
  .card-mark { position: absolute; right: -1rem; bottom: -3.8rem; color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--primary-color) 8%, transparent); font-family: var(--font-editorial); font-size: 13rem; font-style: italic; line-height: 1; pointer-events: none; }
  .primary-card { background: var(--primary-color); color: #fff; border-color: var(--primary-color); }
  .primary-card > p, .primary-card li::before { color: rgba(255,255,255,.72); }
  .primary-card ul { color: rgba(255,255,255,.82); }
  .primary-card .card-mark { color: rgba(255,255,255,.07); }
  .about-details { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
  .about-details .section-heading { padding-top: 2.5rem; }
  .detail-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 180px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 2rem; padding: 2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
  .detail-label { color: var(--primary-color); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .detail-row h3 { margin-bottom: .25rem; font-size: 1.25rem; }
  .detail-row div > p { color: var(--text-muted); }
  .detail-row small { display: block; margin-top: .65rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .tool-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .6rem; }
  .tool-list span { padding: .5rem .8rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--card-bg); font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600; }
  .about-contact { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; max-width: 930px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); border-radius: 26px; background: var(--card-bg); box-shadow: 0 12px 38px rgba(0,0,0,.055); }
  .about-contact h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); letter-spacing: -.035em; word-break: keep-all; }
  .contact-links { display: grid; align-content: center; gap: 1rem; }
  .contact-links a { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .88rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .contact-links a:hover { color: var(--primary-color); }
  .contact-links span { display: block; margin-bottom: .15rem; color: var(--text-color); font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; min-height: auto; }
    .about-portrait, .about-portrait img { width: 112px; height: 112px; }
    .about-portrait span { width: 2.8rem; height: 2.8rem; }
    .about-intro h1 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 12vw, 4rem); }
    .interest-grid, .about-contact { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .interest-card { min-height: 290px; }
    .detail-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .7rem; }
  }
</style>
